# Al Haider Fast Food — Environment Variables

# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# SUPABASE (Required for orders and admin)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://app.supabase.com → Your Project → Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# - NEVER commit your actual values to Git
# - Copy this file to .env and fill in real values
# - The ANON key is safe for browser use (it's public)
# - NEVER put the service_role key here — use it server-side only
# - Add these same variables to Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
